The files in voice-files/ are speaker embeddings from Gradium's Phonon voices
(https://huggingface.co/gradium/phonon-voices, Apache License 2.0), copied unchanged: the 25 English
catalogue voices and 12 English character voices. Each is named by its voice id. See voices/phonon-31m-en.json
for what each one is called and how it is described.

Underdog Woof (https://underdog.ai/woof, https://huggingface.co/ConwayResearch/Underdog-Woof) is not copied into this repository:
voices/woof-en.json names the file and its hash, and the app downloads it from Hugging Face. It is under the Underdog
Non-Commercial License 1.0, which asks that an app using it shows "Voice by Underdog Woof" with a link to underdog.ai.
